# Pairs with PeerAuthorityBounded. A commit whose cache was lost rebuilds under
# peer authority from sources it trusts from the earlier prepare.
MODULE: PeerRestoreRebuildSkipsSourceRecheck
TARGET: PeerAuthorityBounded
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a commit that lost its shadow rebuilds without re-checking the backup's sources
PERTURBS: Commit

--- FIND
          ELSE IF ~cached /\ up /\ ~SourcesEnrolled(b, t)
--- REPLACE
          ELSE IF FALSE
--- END
